    "long_instructions": "#### Change the words and tone\r\n\r\n1. Pick a section of your site.\r\n2. Ask the AI to rewrite its words in a tone that fits your audience. Use the section's name in your prompt.\r\n3. Try it out. Then ask for a different tone, like funny, serious, or friendly, and keep the one that fits best.\r\n\r\n*Example: “Rewrite the About section to sound funny and casual, like I’m talking to a friend.”*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it use the section's name and the tone you want?",
